          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: অনুকূল",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অনুকূল — ônukūl — \"favourable\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আবহাওয়া অনুকূল হলে আমরা কাল নৌকায় যাব। ābôhāoyā ônukūl hôle āmrā kāl noukāy jābô. If the weather is favourable, we'll go by boat tomorrow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অনুকূল (ônukūl) is Sanskrit anukūla, 'along the bank', and so going with you, favourable (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
