          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অভ্যস্ত হওয়া (ôbhyôstô hôoyā) is Sanskrit abhyasta, practised (Monier-Williams), with হওয়া: to become practised at living with something, to get used to it. What you get used to takes -এ."
            }
